## https://github.com/agavra/tuicr/blob/main/README.md#keybindings
tuicr: Down/up                                  | k/j
tuicr: Half-page down/up                        | C-d/u
tuicr: Top/bottom                               | g/G
tuicr: Previous/next file                       | {/}
tuicr: Previous/next hunk                       | [/]
tuicr: Search                                   | /
tuicr: Add line/file comment                    | c/C
tuicr: Visual mode (range comment)              | v/V
tuicr: Toggle file reviewed                     | r
tuicr: Toggle hunk reviewed                     | R
tuicr: Copy review to clipboard                 | y
tuicr: Open focused file in $EDITOR             | :edit
tuicr: Push review to GitHub                    | :submit
tuicr: Complete or cycle commands (in : prompt) | Tab
tuicr: Toggle full help                         | ?